# Runtime config lives in %USERPROFILE%\ani-rss (on Linux: ./config) and is never
# inside the repo. The entries below are defence in depth, so that running the
# portable build from inside the repo cannot accidentally stage runtime files.
# Update backup and rollback artefacts created by PortableUpdate in the program dir.
